# Canonical documentation assets — exceptions to sim_outputs/ ignore above.
# These assets are referenced by \includegraphics{} calls in the public
# manuscript volumes (vol_0 / vol_1 / vol_3 / vol_4 — the make vol9 dep chain)
# and are required for downstream builds to resolve from clean worktrees.
# The un-ignore-then-re-ignore-then-allowlist pattern matches the
# data/pantheon_plus convention below — required because a bare `sim_outputs/`
# rule excludes the parent directory, and git cannot re-include files under an
# excluded parent. Maintained as an explicit allowlist of named documentation
# assets; new simulation outputs remain ignored by default.
!assets/sim_outputs/
assets/sim_outputs/*
!assets/sim_outputs/lattice_structure_3d.png
!assets/sim_outputs/aluminum_27_magnetism.png
